	(text_box "Absolute max power consumption for a PI5 is 10W. Standard pi supply is 15.3W (which we would specify as a requirement).\n\nFrom here we have 5.3W, ~1A for any USB-A peripherals and our hardware.\n\nI think it's reasonable for us to assume we have around 300mA to use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
